### =============================================
### TEST SINGLE BANK API - Simplified Endpoints
### =============================================
### Các endpoint đơn giản hóa để test 1 bank
### =============================================

### --- Health Check ---
GET http://localhost:8001/health

###

### --- Xem danh sách tài khoản ---
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts

###

### =============================================
### 1. SIMPLE TRANSFER (Auto 2PC)
### Tự động chạy PREPARE → COMMIT
### =============================================

### 1.1 DEBIT (trừ tiền) - Simple
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 100000
}

###

### 1.2 CREDIT (cộng tiền) - Simple
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC002",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 500000
}

###

### =============================================
### 2. FULL 2PC FLOW (Chi tiết từng phase)
### Trả về log chi tiết PREPARE → COMMIT
### =============================================

### 2.1 Full 2PC - DEBIT
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/full-2pc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-FULL-2PC-001",
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 200000
}

###

### 2.2 Full 2PC - CREDIT
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/full-2pc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC003",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 1000000
}

###

### 2.3 Full 2PC - Insufficient balance (sẽ fail ở PREPARE)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/full-2pc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC002",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 999999999
}

###

### =============================================
### 3. CHECK TRANSACTION STATUS
### =============================================

### Xem trạng thái transaction
GET http://localhost:8001/api/single/status/TX-FULL-2PC-001

###

### =============================================
### 4. RESET ACCOUNT (Testing Utility)
### =============================================

### Reset ACC001 về 10 triệu
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC001?new_balance=10000000

### Reset ACC002 về 5 triệu
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC002?new_balance=5000000

### Reset tất cả accounts về giá trị mặc định
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC001?new_balance=10000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC002?new_balance=5000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC003?new_balance=15000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC004?new_balance=8000000

###
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/reset-account/ACC005?new_balance=20000000

###

### =============================================
### 5. SIMULATE CRASH SCENARIO
### Test recovery flow
### =============================================

### 5.1 Trước tiên tạo 1 PREPARED transaction
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-CRASH-TEST",
    "account_id": "ACC004",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 100000
}

### 5.2 Giả lập crash (không commit, để transaction stuck)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/simulate-crash/TX-CRASH-TEST

### 5.3 Kiểm tra recovery status - sẽ thấy TX pending
GET http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/status

### 5.4 Force rollback để cleanup
POST http://localhost:8001/api/recovery/force-rollback

### 5.5 Verify account đã được unlock
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC004

###

### =============================================
### 6. MANUAL 2PC FLOW (Step by step)
### =============================================

### 6.1 PREPARE
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-MANUAL-001",
    "account_id": "ACC005",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 500000
}

### 6.2 Check account is locked
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC005

### 6.3 Check transaction status
GET http://localhost:8001/api/single/status/TX-MANUAL-001

### 6.4 Option A: COMMIT
POST http://localhost:8001/api/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-MANUAL-001"
}

### 6.4 Option B: ROLLBACK (thay vì commit)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-MANUAL-001"
}

### 6.5 Verify final state
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts/ACC005

###

### =============================================
### 7. EDGE CASES
### =============================================

### 7.1 Account không tồn tại
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC_NOT_EXIST",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 1000
}

### 7.2 Amount = 0 (invalid)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 0
}

### 7.3 Negative amount (invalid)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/single/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": -1000
}

###

### =============================================
### 8. VIEW ALL DATA
### =============================================

### All accounts
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts

### All transactions
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions

### Filter COMMITTED transactions
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions?status_filter=COMMITTED

### Filter ABORTED transactions
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions?status_filter=ABORTED

### Filter PREPARED transactions (pending)
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions?status_filter=PREPARED


